<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>In every category, the information you can view increases as the scenarios progress.<PG>
An announcement is made each time the information increases, so please check it.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "チュートリアル" "グラフィック\メニュー\右クリック\ワード\チュートリアル人物.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "350" "70" "600" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
In the 'People' category in particular, information on the same person keeps being added according to how far you have progressed.<PG>
Even for people you have seen, please check from time to time whether they have been updated.<PG>
And this is important: the contents of the encyclopedia increase not only with the scenarios, but also with how much of the References you have viewed.<PG>
It is possible to follow the scenarios of this world without looking at the References. However, how deeply you can come to know it is another matter.<PG>
If you wish to know it more deeply, please check both the References and the encyclopedia thoroughly.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "チュートリアル" "グラフィック\メニュー\右クリック\ワード\チュートリアルカテゴリ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
There is a button marked 'RF' on the right side; clicking this button moves you directly to the References.<PG>
There is a similar button on the References side as well, so please use these to go back and forth between the References and the encyclopedia.<PG>
It is also possible to move to the References with the R button, and to the encyclopedia with the D button.<PG>
Also, right-clicking the back button cancels everything and closes the encyclopedia.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "チュートリアル" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------